    "content": {
      "rendered": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"1797\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2017/12/28/water-001/material_297/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/12/material_297.png?fit=800%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"800,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Material_297\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/12/material_297.png?fit=800%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1797\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/12/material_297.png?resize=800%2C800&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Material_297\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"1797\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2017/12/28/water-001/material_297/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/12/material_297.png?fit=800%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"800,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Material_297\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/12/material_297.png?fit=800%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1797 lazyload\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20800%20800%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" alt=\"Material_297\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" data-src=\"https://3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/12/material_297.png\"></p>\n<h2>Water 001 – Free PBR seamless texture, 1024 x 1024, with the following maps:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Color</li>\n<li>Normal</li>\n<li>Displacement</li>\n<li>Roughness</li>\n<li>Ambient Occlusion</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3QAtnYLXWXs?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p>Discover the versatility of these seamless PBR textures and Stylized textures designed to elevate your digital creations. Whether you&#8217;re a seasoned artist or a budding designer, these meticulously crafted textures offer unparalleled realism and detail to your projects.</p>\n<div class=\"jetpack-video-wrapper\"><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/35r38cRBBf4?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></div>\n<p><!--more--></p>\n<blockquote><p><strong>For Tier 3 Patrons, there&#8217;s a 4K resolution uncompressed PNG version of this texture. There&#8217;s also a SBS/SBSAR files (<a href=\"https://3dtextures.me/2016/04/22/what-are-sbs-sbsar-files/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">what are these?</a>) for texture customization and access to the Material Library tool (<a href=\"https://3dtextures.me/2017/12/02/news-and-updates/\">What is it?</a>)</strong></p></blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.redbubble.com/people/gendosplace/explore?asc=u&amp;page=1&amp;sortOrder=recent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"6209\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2020/10/30/ground-wet-rocks-002/print-2/\" data-ori